ce_id\": \"E179\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#pleasureYacht\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"Class\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Pleasure yacht\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"pleasureYacht\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"IMO26-002 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.2 | Chapter 9-1 applicability; IMO26-016 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.5 | Chapter 11-1 applicability\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E180\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#fishingVessel> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#module> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#moduleCore> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E181\", \"kind\": \"SOURCE\", \"text\": \"                               Table 6-5: Load cases for ducted propellers.\\n                 Force               Loaded area                        Right handed propeller\\n                                                                        blade seen from behind\\n Load case 1     Fb                  Uniform pressure applied on the\\n                                     blade back (suction side) to an\\n                                     area from 0.6R to the tip and\\n                                     from the leading edge to 0.2\\n                                     times the chord length.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n Load case 3     Ff                          Uniform pressure applied on the\\n                                             blade face (pressure side) to an\\n                                             area from 0.6R to the tip and\\n                                             from the leading edge to 0.5\\n                                             times the chord length.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n Load case 5     60% of Ff or                Uniform pressure applied on the\\n                 Fb, whichever               face (pressure side) to an area\\n                 is greater                  from 0.6R to the tip and from\\n                                             blade the trailing edge to 0.2\\n                                             times the chord length.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\", \"origin\": {\"file\": \"data/requirements/TRAFICOM_full.txt\", \"authority\": \"User-supplied retained source document; interpretations are not independently verified\", \"selection\": {\"start\": 98900, \"end\": 100257}}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E182\", \"kind\": \"SOURCE\", \"text\": \"                                                                                                             Regulation\\n                                                                                                                           1 (65)\\n                                                                             TRAFICOM/68863/03.04.01.00/2021\\n\\n\\n\\nIssued:                         Enters into force:              Validity:\\n1 July 2021                     5 July 2021                     untill further notice\\n\\nLegal basis:\\nAct on the Ice Classes of Ships and Icebreaker Assistance (1121/2005) section 4(1)\\n\\n\\nProvisions on sanctions for operations violating this Regulation are laid down in:\\n\\n\\n\\nImplemented EU legislation:\\n\\n\\n\\nModification details:\\nIce Class Regulations ant the Application Thereof TRAFI/494131/03.04.01.00/2016\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nIce Class Regulations and the Application Thereof\\n\\n\\n\\n\", \"origin\": {\"file\": \"data/requirements/TRAFICOM_full.txt\", \"authority\": \"User-supplied retained source document; interpretations are not independently verified\", \"selection\": {\"start\": 0, \"end\": 897}}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E183\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#fishingVessel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Fishing vessel\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E184\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#engineOutputFormulaFactorF1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> \\\"NORMALIZED (R9 development): Engine output formula factor f1 represents the linked requirement entity, relationship, value, evidence role, or quantity; its scope is limited to the cited requirements.\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E185\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceClass> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-013\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E186\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#navigatingInIce> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#unitDecisionStatus> \\\"Not a quantity property\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E187\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceClass> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-003\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E188\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceClass> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-040\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E189\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#oilTanker> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceAlias> \\\"oil_tanker\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E190\", \"kind\": \"SOURCE\", \"text\": \"                                                                   Table 6-6: Values of Nclass\\n                                              Ice Class               IA Super IA            IB                             IC\\n                                              impacts in life/nn        9 ∙ 106    6 ∙ 106     3.4 ∙ 106                     2.1 ∙ 106\\n\\n                       Table 6-7: Values of the propeller location factor k1\\n           Centre propeller             Wing propeller         Pulling propeller (wing\\n           Bow first operation          Bow first operation and centre)\\n                                                               Bow propeller or\\n                                                               Stern first operation\\n           k1         1                 2                      3\\n\\f                                                                                        Regulation\\n                                                                                              37 (65)\\n                                                                     TRAFICOM/68863/03.04.01.00/2021\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n        The submersion factor k2 is determined from the equation\\n\\n                 𝑘𝑘2 = 0.8 − 𝑓𝑓       , when 𝑓𝑓 < 0\\n                     = 0.8 − 0.4𝑓𝑓    , when 0 ≤ 𝑓𝑓 ≤ 1\\n                                                                                             (6.15)\\n                     = 0.6 − 0.2𝑓𝑓    , when 1 < 𝑓𝑓 ≤ 2.5\\n                     = 0.1            , when 𝑓𝑓 > 2.5,\\n\\n\\n        where the immersion function f is\\n\\n                                                 ℎ0 −𝐻𝐻𝑖𝑖𝑖𝑖𝑖𝑖\\n                                          𝑓𝑓 =                − 1,                           (6.16)\\n                                                   𝐷𝐷⁄2\\n\\n        where ℎ0 is the depth of the propeller centreline at the lower ice waterline (LIWL) of the\\n        ship.\\n\\n        The propulsion machinery type factor k3 is 1 for fixed propulsors and 1.2 for azimuthing\\n        propulsors.\\n\\nFor components that are subject to loads resulting from propeller/ice interaction with all the\\npropeller blades, the number of load cycles (Nice) must be multiplied by the number of propel-\\nler blades (Z).\\n\\n\", \"origin\": {\"file\": \"data/requirements/TRAFICOM_full.txt\", \"authority\": \"User-supplied retained source document; interpretations are not independently verified\", \"selection\": {\"start\": 103980, \"end\": 106201}}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E191\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceClass> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-010\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E192\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#openWaterIceCondition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceConditionValue> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E193\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#engineOutputRegulationEdition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#benchmarkEntity> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E194\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#shipSizeEngineOutputCoefficientK> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> \\\"coefficientK\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E195\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceClassIc\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"NamedIndividual\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"IC\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"iceClassIc\\\", \\\"mapping_basis\\\": \\\"Ontology declaration (registry row not required)\\\", \\\"types\\\": [\\\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept\\\", \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/voca